Thanks for the feedback!
I suspect other people will have similar complaints, so I have added
quick n' dirty "blown up" 30x18 and 40x24 versions, which should both
still be cleaner than a 30x15 setup. Because my ISP has been known to
get snotty about storage space, they are presented as .PNG files, and
will need to be re-saved as .BMPs. (if anyone's got extra space to
store/present the .BMPs, feel free!)

Note: The whole point of the set was to fit an entire level on the
screen at once, but it -is- sorta amusing playing at 40x24 on my
smallish monitor and seeing only the immediate area of the dungeon as
my test charater wanders around..
